part vat_3
  tally 1
  law
  note "VAT-3 · The tax point and the invoice. VAT is due on the invoice's issue day; the invoice is issued by the 15th of the month after the supply (.1); the VAT is the net times the rate, rounded (.2, GEN-5 .2); on an invoice in florens the VAT is also stated in dukats, converted under GEN-4 with the issue day as the event (.3)."
  note "No figure: the households' invoice defs apply it."

source vat_3 "Value Added Tax Act, VAT-3 The tax point and the invoice (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version vat3_v1
  cite vat_3
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "VAT-3 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-09-01; governs supplies from 2018-01-01."
